            {
                "entry_id": "233a028e-a31b-3702-a22b-7efd649b81c8",
                "word": "Karen",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c7224035-750b-4ee6-b2eb-64bcd19ce625",
                        "entry_id": "233a028e-a31b-3702-a22b-7efd649b81c8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Karens"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "9b2db679-46e6-4175-b9f5-23d198ab7c17",
                        "entry_id": "233a028e-a31b-3702-a22b-7efd649b81c8",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "karen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7b9f1f6a-cf2b-38c4-95d7-c493b493a11d",
                        "entry_id": "233a028e-a31b-3702-a22b-7efd649b81c8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "(Antonomase) Femme blanche d’âge moyen et de classe moyenne qui s’insurge de tout et revendiquant des droits supérieurs aux autres, souvent en perpétuant un racisme systémique."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism",
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d7ef20a-d494-4cc4-a1e1-4b700b0c2ea0",
                                "sense_id": "7b9f1f6a-cf2b-38c4-95d7-c493b493a11d",
                                "text": "L’une appelle la police en scandant qu’un homme afro-américain la menace alors qu’il lui demande poliment de tenir son chien en laisse dans Central Park à New York. Cette Karen a depuis été licenciée."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a508dcef-a1c7-415e-ac20-40e77db2ca8a",
                                "sense_id": "7b9f1f6a-cf2b-38c4-95d7-c493b493a11d",
                                "text": "Plus largement, une \"Karen\" pense être dans son droit dans toutes les circonstances, quitte à parfois mettre la vie des autres en danger."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "426e7765-18e2-48d4-b5b7-99dd09a49d4b",
                                "sense_id": "7b9f1f6a-cf2b-38c4-95d7-c493b493a11d",
                                "text": "Et oui, une Karen qui fait un melt-down à cause d'un block, qui malgré une tentative de déconfliction de ma part me balance \"je refuse que vous me bloquiez, Mme Lamy\" (ce qui est terrifiant, en fait), c'est un non-événement pour la majorité de gens ici."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "894306b0-394c-4441-b4d2-e8833398c06a",
                                "sense_id": "7b9f1f6a-cf2b-38c4-95d7-c493b493a11d",
                                "text": "Y’a une Karen qui a commencé à me fixer, elle m’a tellement saoulé que j’ai commencé à faire exprès d’amplifier mes maniérismes un peu bizarres et à remuer avec la musique"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "01f9bc79-ac72-4e27-90c6-5587a9171f23",
                        "source_entry_id": "233a028e-a31b-3702-a22b-7efd649b81c8",
                        "source_sense_id": "7b9f1f6a-cf2b-38c4-95d7-c493b493a11d",
                        "target_lang_word": "Karen",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Karen",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc5d4f1b-ae38-3bd3-9110-4962625a8ae8",
                                        "entry_id": "d676d329-a9e5-366e-8441-4a3440e52fa2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female given name from Ancient Greek."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85bed4fa-aaec-4ede-98f8-35db6370f4ff",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5d4f1b-ae38-3bd3-9110-4962625a8ae8",
                                                "text": "Left you a lover in that far land, / O Karen sad, that you pine so long! / Would I could unravel and understand / That sorrowful, sweet Norwegian song!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ec176f1-8859-43cd-ae44-62560d56b8a9",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5d4f1b-ae38-3bd3-9110-4962625a8ae8",
                                                "text": "I was not called Karen after Hans Andersen's dancing girl, but after a Danish friend of my mother's who married an Englishman and was my godmother. So much for our family affairs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Karen",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7dab7333-f34d-30c3-b579-59109f286504",
                                        "entry_id": "cba19e7d-4769-3bd1-ae7e-6843ad797e63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A middle-aged white woman who exhibits a strong sense of white privilege and entitlement—often rooted in racism against minority races—and frequently targets or antagonizes individuals who face greater societal challenges or must work significantly harder than she."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a81fb578-f0ce-4f27-9643-6d46f05b23c1",
                                                "sense_id": "7dab7333-f34d-30c3-b579-59109f286504",
                                                "text": "“I pull out the dog treats I carry for just for such intransigence,” he wrote. “That’s when I started video recording with my iPhone, and when her inner Karen fully emerged and took a dark turn,” he said, using the name that has become slang for an entitled white woman."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcffc81a-d813-485a-8692-ffed2830b909",
                                                "sense_id": "7dab7333-f34d-30c3-b579-59109f286504",
                                                "text": "It was through that performance that Amy Cooper took on the mantle of an American archetype: the white woman who weaponizes her vulnerability to exact violence upon a Black man. […] In 2020, she is simply Karen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ac48c58-fffc-4a1f-9c9f-ace35a942a17",
                                                "sense_id": "7dab7333-f34d-30c3-b579-59109f286504",
                                                "text": "“If I lived Chloe’s life, where she was walking around with other wealthy people basically being upper-class Karens having a fit when their dogs aren’t allowed at yoga, then I might understand,” he said."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c88187f-c3dc-4051-adfd-1ae142ac7404",
                                                "sense_id": "7dab7333-f34d-30c3-b579-59109f286504",
                                                "text": "He plays a suburban homeowner who loves nothing more than to snitch on his fellow whites, calling the cops on any Caucasian who steps foot on his lawn, be they old lady, a girl scout, or Colin Jost. Charlie xcx gets in on the action as his proud Karen of a wife."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e2a92da-233e-3914-8e21-abb9f9071495",
                                        "entry_id": "cba19e7d-4769-3bd1-ae7e-6843ad797e63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any person, especially female, exhibiting an exaggerated sense of entitlement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6acb7a9d-9080-41af-a2e1-7821ac01493b",
                                                "sense_id": "1e2a92da-233e-3914-8e21-abb9f9071495",
                                                "text": "This Karen threatened to get me fired if I didn't give her a free meal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9bd9470-fc4f-41d5-8191-1375965ab15b",
                                                "sense_id": "1e2a92da-233e-3914-8e21-abb9f9071495",
                                                "text": "2021 Adam Korson as Phil Orley in \"Ft. Ghost Child\", episode five of SurrealEstate\nThe organization wasn't meeting my needs, so I became a total Karen and asked to see the manager. He wasn't available so I took my business elsewhere."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Karen",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36c10917-fd08-345f-9753-fb96b4afed4b",
                                        "entry_id": "7a2f0a2b-5d3a-35fc-b2ec-b82172b8c57a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of the seven great Parthian feudal families."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "200de4bf-f964-3575-963c-14f0c5322941",
                                        "entry_id": "7a2f0a2b-5d3a-35fc-b2ec-b82172b8c57a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A transliteration of the Armenian male given name Կարեն (Karen)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Karen",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1393f57c-b255-3447-8316-07f0986cded1",
                                        "entry_id": "5f358d01-e62a-37e9-8319-c8c5a20e16a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of a diverse ethnic group originating in Myanmar and Thailand."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88b4d861-467b-4ec9-9088-61796c5c2270",
                                                "sense_id": "1393f57c-b255-3447-8316-07f0986cded1",
                                                "text": "U Nu's government was Socialist with a program of nationalization. But it had to fight for survival against almost universal disorder complicated by a Communist rebellion, a Karen rising, which was far more serious, and, in 1950, the arrival from Yünnan of General Li Mi's Kuomintang division after its rout by the Chinese Communists."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10c41182-ad35-4627-ae64-d9d0a10eb80d",
                                                "sense_id": "1393f57c-b255-3447-8316-07f0986cded1",
                                                "text": "There are more than a hundred such groups, including the Karen of Thailand and Burma; the Kachin in Burma; the Akha, the Lahu, and the Lisu in Thailand; the Hmong, the Kmhmu, and the Yao in Laos; and the Nùng and the Lati in Vietnam."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Karen",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ad43040-925a-3bc2-8dab-eab993e57e9a",
                                        "entry_id": "8bed7883-b07e-30b9-8fc9-2664ae9e1d82",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A group of Sino-Tibetan languages spoken by people of the Karen ethnic group, also called Karenic."
                                        ],
